        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Ecuador for New Year: the Andes and the Galápagos"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "56f332df32ec36b72a4f4f9277cde01ff07acb65dd0a8319c544fc5b14d73890",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-97d3eeec2bfb-mw9olsy5",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Spend New Year in Quito, visit high-altitude lakes and waterfalls in the Andes, and explore Chimborazo, Ingapirca and Cuenca before spending four days in the Galápagos. Guaranteed group departure from 30 December 2026 to 9 January 2027, with 11 days and 10 nights and up to 15 participants. An English-speaking guide accompanies the group on the mainland, and an English-speaking guide is provided on the islands."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:priceNote:9b6b7f5cf7b1e557",
