        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-97d3eeec2bfb-mw9olsy5",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Per person: TPL (triple occupancy) — USD 4,250. DBL (double occupancy) — USD 4,325. SGL (single occupancy) — USD 4,970."
